<title>UK: BOE allots 1.323 bln stg in outright bills, repo.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 1.323 bln stg in outright bills, repo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 1.323 billion stg of assistance.</p>
<p>It allotted 93 million stg in bills outright and 1.23 bln stg in repos to April 9, 10 and 11.</p>
<p>The Bank has revised up the forecast of the total liquidity shortage to 2.4 billion stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
</text>
